LPL verySimpleLogic description

	// This example is so simple that it does not show the
	// powerful mechanism allowing to describe the syntax of
	// the ``.spc'' file. This will be introduced later.

	// the end user will be allowed to ask queries of sort ``foo''
  query    of sort foo

	// and the answer will be of the same sort
  result   of sort foo

	// indeed in this case the sort of the query and of the answer
	// are the same (foo). This sort is described in the module
	// ``verySimpleModule'' which is given in the file 
	// ``verysimpleModule.eln''.
	// Note that these last two names (the module name and the file 
	// name) should be the same.
  modules  verySimpleModule

	// We start the evaluation by reducing the term under query 
	// using the strategy ``simpleStrategy''.
  start with (simpleStrategy)query

end of LPL description
